&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Great work environment with a young, international team of talented people!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We have free food, drink, and fruit at the office!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
