&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Strategy team, we&lt;/strong&gt; drive growth by attracting new users and increasing the reach, visibility, and sales of our experiences and brands. We create &lt;strong&gt;data-driven campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; that connect with the right audiences across channels like &lt;strong&gt;Meta, TikTok, Google, TV, and more&lt;/strong&gt;. From strategy to execution, we’re focused on generating awareness, boosting engagement, and turning interest into action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Join us and help shape the campaigns that inspire millions to discover and book unforgettable experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Marketing Strategist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth by designing high-impact campaigns that capture audience attention and drive tangible sales across a diverse media mix. Operating at the intersection of data and creativity, you will shape the narrative frameworks that introduce millions of users to unforgettable experiences worldwide. In this role, you will collaborate across dynamic growth channels to transform audience interest into loyal customers, helping to elevate our brands on a global scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You´ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own and drive the full marketing strategy for your experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop compelling and scalable marketing plans for exclusive experiences worldwide, both for partners and for our unique Fever Original events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;357&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Launch and optimize high-visibility performance marketing campaigns across social channels such as Facebook and Instagram.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;618&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with the growth marketing team to analyze results, identify opportunities, and continuously improve performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leverage advanced data insights to guide strategic decisions, uncover growth opportunities, and refine marketing models over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1026&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bring strong analytical capabilities with deep command of performance metrics, forecasting, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally with Sales, Media, CRM, Design, and Content teams to provide strategic direction for campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Grow and scale your portfolio of experiences with a proactive and entrepreneurial mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1248&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrate strong executive communication skills and confidently lead meetings with partners and internal teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have +6 years of experience in Digital Marketing, Facebook ads and other social paid platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have a native/bilingual level of English. A second language is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
