&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPANY OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing Manager, Content Strategies&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;shaping and executing content that tells a compelling brand story across digital, event, and web experiences. This role leads a team of content contributors and works cross-functionally to ensure messaging is clear, consistent, and impactful—from long-form storytelling to concise, high-performing event copy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who can both manage people and craft great content. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 113, 200);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role will be based in Orlando, FL and is an in-office position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB SCOPE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and manage a team of&amp;nbsp;content developers, providing direction, feedback, and professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own content strategy across channels, including website copy, campaigns, events, and brand initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear, engaging narratives that translate complex topics into accessible, compelling stories.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and edit high-quality content, ensuring consistency in tone, voice, and messaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee website copy development,&amp;nbsp;optimizing for&amp;nbsp;clarity, structure, and audience intent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and refine&amp;nbsp;short-form&amp;nbsp;copy&amp;nbsp;for event booths, signage, and experiential marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with demand generation, product marketing, design, and events teams to align content with business goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve content deliverables, ensuring accuracy, quality, and strategic alignment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience directly managing and supervising a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and editing skills, with a strong portfolio&amp;nbsp;demonstrating&amp;nbsp;storytelling&amp;nbsp;expertise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience writing and&amp;nbsp;optimizing&amp;nbsp;website&amp;nbsp;copy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise&amp;nbsp;in developing concise, high-impact copy for event booths and in-person marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills and experience working cross-functionally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple projects in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B marketing, technology,&amp;nbsp;ideally&amp;nbsp;experience in&amp;nbsp;cybersecurity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with content performance metrics and optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing brand voice and messaging frameworks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WORKING CONDITIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The duties described below are representative of those encountered while performing the essential functions of this position. If necessary, reasonable accommodation may be requested and will be evaluated for its relationship to the essential functions that must be performed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job will generally be performed in an office environment but may require travel to visit company offices and/or property locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While performing duties of this job, would occasionally require to stand, walk, sit, reach with hands and arms, climb or balance, stoop or kneel, talk and hear, and use fingers and hands to feel objects and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must occasionally lift and/or move up to 50&amp;nbsp; pounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Specific vision abilities required include close vision, distance vision, depth perceptions, and the ability to adjust focus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 113, 200);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A background check and drug/substance screening are required after a conditional offer. Employment will proceed only upon receiving clear results from both.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 113, 200);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ThreatLocker also conducts randomized drug and substance testing approximately every 60 days, in line with the same screening standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

